(American Latin Class - Parameterized URI Documentation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RESTful standard used:) Tj
T*
(- Collections use plural nouns such as /api/students and /api/teachers.) Tj
T*
(- Single resources append an ID parameter in braces, such as /api/students/{studentId}.) Tj
T*
(- Real requests replace the parameter with a numeric ID, such as /api/students/1.) Tj
T*
(- GET is used for read-only lookup.) Tj
T*
(- Protected endpoints keep role middleware and branch access validation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Added URIs:) Tj
T*
(GET /api/branches/{branchId} -> example /api/branches/1 -> get one branch by ID -> public) Tj
T*
(GET /api/students/{studentId} -> example /api/students/1 -> get one student by ID -> director) Tj
T*
(GET /api/teachers/{teacherId} -> example /api/teachers/1 -> get one teacher by ID -> director) Tj
T*
(GET /api/class-plans/{classPlanId} -> example /api/class-plans/1 -> get one class plan by ID -> teacher/director) Tj
T*
(GET /api/attendance-records/{attendanceRecordId} -> example /api/attendance-records/1 -> get one attendance record by ID -> teacher/director) Tj
T*
(GET /api/branch-finance-reports/{financeReportId} -> example /api/branch-finance-reports/1 -> get one finance report by ID -> director) Tj
T*
(GET /api/professional-events/{eventId} -> example /api/professional-events/1 -> get one professional event by ID -> director) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implementation summary:) Tj
T*
(1. The route file 06Code/Controller/routes/api.php maps each URI to a show method.) Tj
T*
(2. Each controller reads the ID from Slim args, for example args[studentId].) Tj
T*
(3. The controller searches the related model by ID.) Tj
T*
(4. If no record exists, the API returns HTTP 404.) Tj
T*
(5. If the user cannot access the branch or role, the API returns HTTP 403.) Tj
T*
(6. Successful responses return the selected record inside a JSON data object.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example request:) Tj
T*
(GET /api/students/1) Tj
T*
(Authorization: Bearer <director-token>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example JSON response:) Tj
T*
({) Tj
T*
(  "data": {) Tj
T*
(    "id": 1,) Tj
T*
(    "full_name": "Example Student",) Tj
T*
(    "branch_id": 1) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
